[# comparison/product-comparison: two to four products side by side: photo, name and price on top, spec rows, and a button under each.

   A preset of comparison/comparison-table with product images in the column headers. Give every product a button or
   none of them. Spec values are text ("Merino wool", "200 g"), yes and no become a check and a cross.

   Compatibility
   - Outlook desktop: tables, images and borders honored.
   - Gmail apps: fine. On phones the columns shrink, keep product names short.
   - Dark mode: cells on the brand surface or background swap via dm-* classes. Header cells keep their colors, product
     images are not recolored. #]
[% set cols = [] %]
[% set foot = [] %]
[% for p in data.products %]
[% set _ = cols.push({ title: p.name, subtitle: p.price, image: p.image, highlight: p.highlight }) %]
[% if p.cta %][% set _ = foot.push(p.cta) %][% endif %]
[% endfor %]
[[ c('comparison/comparison-table', { heading: data.heading, intro: data.intro, columns: cols, rows: data.rows, footer: (foot if foot.length else none) }, { variant: s.tableVariant, settings: { hideOnMobile: s.hideOnMobile, hideOnDesktop: s.hideOnDesktop } }) ]]
